  "releaseNotes": "v2.0.4 Release - Production Ready! 🎉\n\n✅ NEW FEATURES:\n• Complete IKeyValueStore interface with 7 essential methods\n• Production-ready InMemoryKeyValueStore with TTL support\n• Enhanced RedisKeyValueStore with full cancellation support\n• CompositeKeyValueStore for flexible backend composition\n• Thread-safe operations across all stores\n\n✅ IMPROVEMENTS:\n• Unified interface across all key-value stores\n• Better testing support with in-memory implementation\n• Enhanced documentation with 20+ real-world examples\n• Comprehensive unit testing examples included\n• All async operations support CancellationToken\n\n✅ USE CASES:\n• E-commerce order processing with sagas\n• Payment processing with idempotency\n• Webhook handlers with duplicate prevention\n• Scheduled jobs with distributed locks\n• Message queue consumers\n• API request deduplication\n\nSee full changelog and examples: https://github.com/mehmet-yoldas/library-core",
